@startuml
title Stepwise Refinement - Level 2 (Decomposition)
start
:Collect Input;
if (Algorithm?) then (Round Robin)
  :Init ready queue;
  :Run RR loop until all complete;
else (FCFS)
  :Sort by arrival (or order);
  :Run FCFS once-through;
endif
:Aggregate events into timeline;
:Compute per-task metrics;
:Format & print results;
stop
@enduml
